# pubspec.lock 提交入库：应用型 Flutter 项目应固定依赖版本，避免
# transitive 依赖（如 flutter_webrtc）在每次 pub get 时漂移（曾漂到 1.5.2
# 触发 Windows GBK 构建错误，见 windows/CMakeLists.txt /utf-8 注释）。
frontend/.packages
frontend/.pub-cache/
frontend/.pub/
frontend/linux/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake
frontend/windows/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake

